'''Candy Corn''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 2nd tier in the Main Event during [[Halloween Event 2020|2020 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is solid black with ten pieces of candy corn scattered along it, all varying in different sizes. The guard is orange, and the handle is solid black.

== Trivia ==
* It has a [[Candy Corn Gun (2020)|partner gun]] under the same name.

